    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Wishlist GRIMWHIMSY to get news about the game.</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3057040/extras/133db20a5221b506865c2a6aa7d46d9e.poster.avif?t=1729296413\" width=604 height=50 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3057040/extras/133db20a5221b506865c2a6aa7d46d9e.webm?t=1729296413\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3057040/extras/133db20a5221b506865c2a6aa7d46d9e.mp4?t=1729296413\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3057040/extras/250a6f260b9784de07314a63dd435984.avif?t=1729296413\" width=600 height=119 /></span><br><br>You and your friends are convicted criminals thrown into the dark and dangerous corridors of a godforsaken laboratory. Your task is to survive and find out what happened in these creepy places.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3057040/extras/7e0cf338e77fc6c46d4a7dcf9beccb64.avif?t=1729296413\" width=600 height=119 /></span><br>Stay alert, as every step could be your last. Use light and shadows to trick the monsters and make your way through.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3057040/extras/43c96d93d1f5287a6270864ffe33da64.avif?t=1729296413\" width=600 height=119 /></span><br>Make each game unique. Gather resources, repair equipment, and avoid traps. Communicate with your friends through text and voice chat, strategize, and help each other survive.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3057040/extras/d0cfbc6116b6efccc3c5be1d1ff84878.avif?t=1729296413\" width=600 height=119 /></span><br>Allows you to earn points for encounters with monsters and completing missions. These points can be exchanged at the flying mailbox for valuable items that will help you survive.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3057040/extras/e669d73cb16b3f0880781a52b36ce81b.avif?t=1729296413\" width=600 height=119 /></span><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><i>While you were healing, a monster ate your friend? A great reason to report to the government and earn points!</i><br></li><li><i>Your friend took your loot? Don't worry, you can always zap them with a stun gun or feed them to the monsters.</i></li></ul><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3057040/extras/c2cbc8a5633f084401c698f5aefa8062.avif?t=1729296413\" width=600 height=119 /></span><br><strong>This is a game about fear, survival, and laughter when everything goes wrong.</strong><br>Can you survive and uncover all the secrets of the abandoned laboratories? Find out for yourself, but don't forget your friend \u2013 who else will distract the monsters?!<br><br><i>That's what friends are for, right? Well, at least that's how it works in our laboratory!</i><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3057040/extras/04b75b90340ff00b7f3cd6a4db823264.poster.avif?t=1729296413\" width=600 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3057040/extras/04b75b90340ff00b7f3cd6a4db823264.webm?t=1729296413\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3057040/extras/04b75b90340ff00b7f3cd6a4db823264.mp4?t=1729296413\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Wishlist GRIMWHIMSY to get news about the game.</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3057040/extras/133db20a5221b506865c2a6aa7d46d9e.poster.avif?t=1729296413\" width=604 height=50 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3057040/extras/133db20a5221b506865c2a6aa7d46d9e.webm?t=1729296413\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3057040/extras/133db20a5221b506865c2a6aa7d46d9e.mp4?t=1729296413\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3057040/extras/250a6f260b9784de07314a63dd435984.avif?t=1729296413\" width=600 height=119 /></span><br><br>You and your friends are convicted criminals thrown into the dark and dangerous corridors of a godforsaken laboratory. Your task is to survive and find out what happened in these creepy places.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3057040/extras/7e0cf338e77fc6c46d4a7dcf9beccb64.avif?t=1729296413\" width=600 height=119 /></span><br>Stay alert, as every step could be your last. Use light and shadows to trick the monsters and make your way through.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3057040/extras/43c96d93d1f5287a6270864ffe33da64.avif?t=1729296413\" width=600 height=119 /></span><br>Make each game unique. Gather resources, repair equipment, and avoid traps. Communicate with your friends through text and voice chat, strategize, and help each other survive.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3057040/extras/d0cfbc6116b6efccc3c5be1d1ff84878.avif?t=1729296413\" width=600 height=119 /></span><br>Allows you to earn points for encounters with monsters and completing missions. These points can be exchanged at the flying mailbox for valuable items that will help you survive.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3057040/extras/e669d73cb16b3f0880781a52b36ce81b.avif?t=1729296413\" width=600 height=119 /></span><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><i>While you were healing, a monster ate your friend? A great reason to report to the government and earn points!</i><br></li><li><i>Your friend took your loot? Don't worry, you can always zap them with a stun gun or feed them to the monsters.</i></li></ul><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3057040/extras/c2cbc8a5633f084401c698f5aefa8062.avif?t=1729296413\" width=600 height=119 /></span><br><strong>This is a game about fear, survival, and laughter when everything goes wrong.</strong><br>Can you survive and uncover all the secrets of the abandoned laboratories? Find out for yourself, but don't forget your friend \u2013 who else will distract the monsters?!<br><br><i>That's what friends are for, right? Well, at least that's how it works in our laboratory!</i><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3057040/extras/04b75b90340ff00b7f3cd6a4db823264.poster.avif?t=1729296413\" width=600 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3057040/extras/04b75b90340ff00b7f3cd6a4db823264.webm?t=1729296413\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3057040/extras/04b75b90340ff00b7f3cd6a4db823264.mp4?t=1729296413\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
    "short_description": "In GrimWhimsy, you and your friends are convicted criminals thrown into the dark corridors of a forgotten laboratory. Survive, trick the monsters, and laugh together when things go wrong. Can you escape this hell? Find out for yourself!",
